<p>Đường mới dự đoán lần lượt <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.7333</mn><mo separator="true">,</mo><mn>3.0000</mn><mo separator="true">,</mo><mn>5.5333</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1.7333,3.0000,5.5333</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="katex-base"><span class="katex-strut" style="height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord">1.7333</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord">3.0000</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord">5.5333</span></span></span></span>. Phần dư là <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.7333</mn><mo separator="true">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator="true">,</mo><mn>2.5333</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.7333,0,2.5333</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="katex-base"><span class="katex-strut" style="height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord">0.7333</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord">0</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord">2.5333</span></span></span></span>, nên gradient mới xấp xỉ <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mn>2.1778</mn><mo separator="true">,</mo><mn>7.2444</mn><msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">⊤</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[2.1778,7.2444]^\\top</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="katex-base"><span class="katex-strut" style="height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">[</span><span class="mord">2.1778</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord">7.2444</span><span class="mclose"><span class="mclose">]</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8491em;"><span style="top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>. Bước kế tiếp đưa trọng số về <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mn>0.2489</mn><mo separator="true">,</mo><mn>0.5422</mn><msup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">⊤</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[0.2489,0.5422]^\\top</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="katex-base"><span class="katex-strut" style="height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"></span><span class="mopen">[</span><span class="mord">0.2489</span><span class="mpunct">,</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class="mord">0.5422</span><span class="mclose"><span class="mclose">]</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:0.8491em;"><span style="top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:2.7em;"></span><span class="katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mtight">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>.</p>
